abstract: >-
  An autonomous quadcopter (Pixhawk + Raspberry Pi 5) that detects six mango-leaf
  diseases in real time with a custom YOLOv8 model, geo-tags infected trees and
  sprays only where disease is found.
keywords:
  - precision agriculture
  - UAV
  - YOLOv8
  - mango leaf disease
  - targeted spraying
